{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["You shall not suffer a sorceress to live — because the way of sorceress women is to do their deeds in secret, in hiding places, in caves, as we find in the case of the eighty women in Ashkelon whom Shimon ben Shetah hanged. Therefore Scripture says: לא תחיה — do not despair of investigating them. Do not let them live on account of laziness, but investigate them to put them to death."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:42:37.753200596Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}